+ }
+ /* 2248b (defect 3): a request is not sent when the dwell has no room left for even a short answer. Sending it would
+  * only produce a stop the firmware never had a chance to answer, which reads as a firmware defect rather than the
+  * dwell's limit. Named plainly, so the log cannot be misread either. */
+ if(w.wlfw_dwell_end && w.wlfw_dwell_end<now+W_W4_MIN_BOUND_MS){
